When you block an attack the shock ripples through your attacker, spreading the force of the Spellblaze in its mind for 5 turns.

While affected the creature will suffer [7%, 14%, 17%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5)] chances to fail using talents and [10, 30, 45, 58, 70 (TL1-5)] reduced physical, mental and spell saves.
